WEBVTT


00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:49.364 --> 00:00:51.699
Get outta my way!


00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:52.767
I called dibs!


00:00:54.702 --> 00:00:57.605
- Are those what I think they are?
- Wow!


00:00:57.639 --> 00:01:01.009
Oh, boy, I had to be late on cookie day!


00:01:01.043 --> 00:01:02.610
Cookie? Cookie? Cookie?


00:01:03.578 --> 00:01:05.513
- Here they come!
- Ah, it's crumb time!


00:01:05.547 --> 00:01:07.082
- I want a piece!
- Cookies! Cookies!


00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.751
They're at it already!


00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:11.718
- Out of my way! I want it!
- Hey, can I squeeze in, guys?


00:01:11.719 --> 00:01:14.289
- I've got beaks to feed!
- Snooze, you lose, Robert!


00:01:14.322 --> 00:01:16.024
- Oh...
- I want that cookie!


00:01:16.058 --> 00:01:17.459
- Hey!
- I called it!


00:01:17.492 --> 00:01:18.493
Snooze, you lose!


00:01:20.128 --> 00:01:22.530
- No touchbacks!
- Hey, no elbows!


00:01:22.564 --> 00:01:23.731
Oh!


00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.669
Aha!


00:01:27.702 --> 00:01:31.573
Come to papa! Ha! Score!


00:01:31.606 --> 00:01:34.342
- Wow!
- Yeah!


00:01:39.781 --> 00:01:43.051
Come on wings, don't fail me!
Don't want to miss it!


00:01:48.223 --> 00:01:49.424
My fellow storks.


00:01:49.457 --> 00:01:51.593
Now that we all have nested,


00:01:51.626 --> 00:01:54.529
we must concentrate on
the education of our offspring.


00:01:56.298 --> 00:01:57.599
Almost there!


00:01:57.632 --> 00:01:59.401
- The migration... Watch out!
- Whoa!


00:01:59.434 --> 00:02:02.337
- Incoming!
- Whoa! Oops! Oh!


00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:04.172
Sorry! Very late.


00:02:04.206 --> 00:02:07.142
Sparrows!


00:02:09.244 --> 00:02:11.713
Made it! Come on, cookie, let's do this.


00:02:11.746 --> 00:02:14.149
Did I miss it? Did I miss it?


00:02:14.182 --> 00:02:17.219
Don't worry, hon, you're just in time.


00:02:17.252 --> 00:02:18.620
Aw, and you brought a treat.


00:02:18.653 --> 00:02:20.722
To celebrate our new arrival!


00:02:25.293 --> 00:02:27.395
Richard, your Dad's here!


00:02:27.429 --> 00:02:31.266
Ha ha, he looks just like
I did at that age.


00:02:31.299 --> 00:02:33.868
Yeah, that's my boy.


00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:36.638
He definitely has your impatience.


00:02:36.671 --> 00:02:40.608
Looks like he's got
your pecking skills too!


00:02:40.642 --> 00:02:42.877
Come on. You can do it!


00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.113
Push, Richard. Push!


00:02:47.782 --> 00:02:49.817
Robert!


00:02:49.851 --> 00:02:52.287
Oh!


00:02:54.356 --> 00:02:56.391
You chose the wrong day, buddy!


00:03:30.392 --> 00:03:31.659
Oh?


00:03:42.537 --> 00:03:44.739
Ooh...


00:03:51.713 --> 00:03:53.248
Who have we here?


00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.485
Richard.


00:03:57.519 --> 00:04:00.522
Well, hello, Richard. I am Aurora.


00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:08.162
Shh... it's all right.


00:04:09.497 --> 00:04:10.865
Here.


00:04:13.235 --> 00:04:14.236
Mmm!


00:04:14.269 --> 00:04:17.905
That's good, isn't it?


00:04:17.939 --> 00:04:19.441
Where are your parents?


00:04:22.677 --> 00:04:24.379
Oh.


00:04:24.412 --> 00:04:25.813
Mommy!


00:04:25.847 --> 00:04:28.350
- Oh, I am not your...
- Mmm...


00:04:28.383 --> 00:04:32.220
Oh... come here.


00:04:32.254 --> 00:04:35.223
Mm... What am I gonna do with you?


00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:46.868
Hold on tight, Richard.


00:05:04.352 --> 00:05:05.620
Wow!


00:05:17.732 --> 00:05:19.967
No fish? What's in here? Frogs?


00:05:20.001 --> 00:05:21.436
No, Max, this is...


00:05:27.008 --> 00:05:29.411
Claudius, my dear.


00:05:29.444 --> 00:05:33.415
One of those pesky sparrows nearly
ruined my speech at the gathering!


00:05:33.448 --> 00:05:34.882
Mmm?


00:05:34.916 --> 00:05:37.785
Pests! What's for dinner?


00:05:37.819 --> 00:05:39.520
There is something I wanted
to talk to you about...


00:05:39.521 --> 00:05:40.755
Daddy!


00:05:40.788 --> 00:05:45.327
Aaah! Get off! Aurora!


00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.063
- Claudius, Max, this is...
- Get it off!


00:05:49.096 --> 00:05:51.299
- Richard!
- Off! Off, off, off!


00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:53.635
What is he doing here?


00:05:58.506 --> 00:06:00.642
He's fun! Can he stay for dinner?


00:06:00.675 --> 00:06:04.679
Certainly not.
Get this feathered leech off me!


00:06:04.712 --> 00:06:07.449
Go play with him, Max.


00:06:07.482 --> 00:06:09.684
Wanna go for a ride, Richard?


00:06:09.717 --> 00:06:11.486
- Max!
- Whoo!


00:06:20.395 --> 00:06:23.331
I found him alone in his nest.


00:06:23.365 --> 00:06:27.335
Sparrows. Stork parents
would never leave a chick!


00:06:27.369 --> 00:06:29.404
They didn't have a choice, Claudius.


00:06:29.437 --> 00:06:32.507
Their nest was... was ravaged.


00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:33.708
Oh...


00:06:33.741 --> 00:06:36.778
Still, this is none of our business.


00:06:36.811 --> 00:06:37.945
Take him back.


00:06:37.979 --> 00:06:40.648
I won't, my dear. I can't.


00:06:41.783 --> 00:06:45.453
Imagine if it was our son,
all alone in the woods.


00:06:45.487 --> 00:06:48.723
Hold on, kid. Turbulence ahead!


00:06:48.756 --> 00:06:50.525
Whoa!


00:06:50.558 --> 00:06:53.628
Where'd you go?


00:06:53.661 --> 00:06:56.464
All right. The sparrow can stay.


00:06:56.498 --> 00:06:58.633
I knew you would understand...


00:06:58.666 --> 00:07:01.035
Only... till the Fall.


00:07:01.068 --> 00:07:04.639
After that, he'll have to
look after himself. Agreed?


00:07:04.672 --> 00:07:06.040
And...


00:07:06.073 --> 00:07:08.410
I don't want the other storks
to know about this.


00:07:08.443 --> 00:07:10.512
And...


00:07:10.545 --> 00:07:12.514
he doesn't call me "Daddy".


00:07:12.547 --> 00:07:14.382
- Daddy!
- Mm?


00:07:14.416 --> 00:07:17.151
Look what I taught him!


00:07:17.184 --> 00:07:21.155
Hee, hee.


00:07:21.188 --> 00:07:23.925
Whoa!


00:07:37.439 --> 00:07:39.707
Whoa! Crazy, Max!


00:07:39.741 --> 00:07:43.077
- Can't handle it, little brother?
- Oh, I can handle it!


00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.880
- Ha ha.
- Faster, Max! Faster!


00:07:47.449 --> 00:07:50.552
Oh... oh... whoa!


00:07:50.585 --> 00:07:52.554
I meant that!


00:07:52.587 --> 00:07:53.921
- Sure you did!
- Whoa!


00:07:57.625 --> 00:07:59.393
Mm-hmm. But silent, okay?


00:08:07.001 --> 00:08:10.572
- I got it!
- Well done, my boy.


00:08:10.605 --> 00:08:12.640
That doesn't look so hard...


00:08:15.009 --> 00:08:16.511
Oh...


00:08:20.682 --> 00:08:21.682
Gotcha!


00:08:24.619 --> 00:08:26.488
Eeeh! Gross! Hmm.


00:08:30.257 --> 00:08:32.594
Whoa! Richard! Flying fish!


00:08:32.627 --> 00:08:34.629
- Yeah! Yeah! Yeah...
- Incoming!


00:08:34.662 --> 00:08:36.664
Ugh! I got it!


00:08:51.646 --> 00:08:55.016
Oh... oh...


00:08:55.049 --> 00:08:56.984
Nice!


00:08:57.018 --> 00:08:59.521
Hmm?


00:09:01.689 --> 00:09:03.491
Sorry, I fell out of bed.


00:09:12.834 --> 00:09:16.671
Come on, Max, I thought you were fast!


00:09:16.704 --> 00:09:18.506
Fast? I'll show you fast!


00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:21.275
Whatever you say, big brother!
I'm waiting!


00:09:21.308 --> 00:09:24.646
- I've almost got you!
- Ha ha, that's what you think!


00:09:24.679 --> 00:09:26.714
- Watch this!
- Richard!


00:09:26.748 --> 00:09:32.720
- Catch me if you can!
- The trees... they're so small!


00:09:32.754 --> 00:09:35.289
Hey! We're not allowed to go that high!


00:09:35.322 --> 00:09:38.059
Come on. Whoa!
You worry too much!


00:09:38.092 --> 00:09:41.563
No, it's too windy! Let's turn around.


00:09:41.596 --> 00:09:43.831
Chicken! A cool breeze
never hurt anyone.


00:09:43.865 --> 00:09:48.235
- Richard!
- Ah! Me and my big mouth!


00:09:48.269 --> 00:09:49.637
Gotcha!


00:09:52.574 --> 00:09:54.676
You didn't get me.


00:09:54.709 --> 00:09:56.611
- I came to you.
- Ha ha, oh, yeah?


00:09:56.644 --> 00:10:00.715
I was nose-diving, beanpole!
Good catch, though.


00:10:04.619 --> 00:10:07.889
- Dad's calling!
- Let's go!


00:10:16.297 --> 00:10:19.333
Why can't we take Richard with us?


00:10:19.366 --> 00:10:22.203
I mean, he's no burden,
and I could carry...


00:10:22.236 --> 00:10:24.706
Oh, be reasonable, Aurora.


00:10:24.739 --> 00:10:27.709
You knew this day would come.


00:10:31.212 --> 00:10:36.718
You are a wonderful mother, and
you have done all you can for him.


00:10:36.751 --> 00:10:39.921
But he won't survive
the journey to Africa.


00:10:39.954 --> 00:10:43.224
He has to live the life of a sparrow.


00:10:44.726 --> 00:10:47.094
Here we are. What's this all about?


00:10:47.128 --> 00:10:49.764
Finally! I've summoned the flock.


00:10:49.797 --> 00:10:52.767
- Come, Max.
- Hey, what about me?


00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:56.671
- I'm coming too, right?
- Hmm. Richard...


00:10:56.704 --> 00:10:59.273
Wait here until we return, all right?


00:10:59.306 --> 00:11:03.778
- What?! Why?!
- Do as you are told.


00:11:03.811 --> 00:11:06.147
- But we go everywhere together!
- Yeah, Mom!


00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:09.116
I'll explain everything
later. I promise.


00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:11.886
This is not fair!


00:11:11.919 --> 00:11:15.256
Max! Quit your lollygagging!


00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:29.236
Ahem. My fellow storks.


00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:34.408
Today, the old oak
has dropped its first leaf.


00:11:34.441 --> 00:11:37.645
The time of the great
migration has arrived.


00:11:37.679 --> 00:11:42.149
Citizens, we must migrate
before the winter comes.


00:11:42.183 --> 00:11:46.153
We will form a flock and fly south
to the Great Lake in Africa.


00:11:46.187 --> 00:11:49.323
Wow! Africa!


00:11:49.356 --> 00:11:51.826
Our journey is long and dangerous.


00:11:51.859 --> 00:11:53.928
- Oh, no no no no...
- And we...


00:11:53.961 --> 00:11:56.731
Mm?


00:12:00.001 --> 00:12:03.370
Hehe, hi there!


00:12:03.404 --> 00:12:06.774
- Richard!
- You know this bird?


00:12:06.808 --> 00:12:10.712
Know me? She's my mom!


00:12:12.379 --> 00:12:15.950
Claudius! Maybe we should
postpone our departure


00:12:15.983 --> 00:12:18.820
until your "family matters"
are resolved?


00:12:18.853 --> 00:12:21.756
My family matters are just fine.


00:12:21.789 --> 00:12:28.696
Richard, your mother... I mean,
Aurora should have told you long ago.


00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:30.397
Told me what?


00:12:30.431 --> 00:12:34.201
You are a sparrow, Richard.


00:12:34.235 --> 00:12:37.772
You cannot migrate.


00:12:37.805 --> 00:12:40.842
You belong here,
with the other sparrows.


00:12:47.782 --> 00:12:49.751
You almost had me there, Dad!


00:12:49.784 --> 00:12:52.319
You always did have such a...
Sense of humor.


00:12:52.353 --> 00:12:57.424
Haha. Hmm. Oh?


00:12:57.458 --> 00:13:00.061
Poor little thing.


00:13:04.799 --> 00:13:06.233
Come with me.


00:13:06.267 --> 00:13:08.335
I have something to show you.


00:13:08.369 --> 00:13:10.738
Hmm. Mom?


00:13:12.406 --> 00:13:13.875
Mom! What do you mean?


00:13:13.908 --> 00:13:15.877
- Wait!
- Richard!


00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:17.378
You stay here, Max.


00:13:17.411 --> 00:13:20.114
- But Dad? I...
- Stay!


00:13:20.147 --> 00:13:21.348
Our meeting is over.


00:13:21.382 --> 00:13:24.852
We shall depart at the break of dawn.


00:13:42.937 --> 00:13:45.072
Where are we?


00:13:45.106 --> 00:13:49.877
I found you here,
in this sparrow's nest.


00:13:49.911 --> 00:13:54.448
Your parents were... taken...
before you hatched.


00:13:54.481 --> 00:13:55.616
No!


00:13:55.649 --> 00:13:58.085
You're my Mom. And I'm coming with you.


00:13:58.119 --> 00:14:00.454
Richard, you can't go to Africa.


00:14:00.487 --> 00:14:03.124
I can, Mom!


00:14:03.157 --> 00:14:05.960
- It's Dad, isn't it?
- Richard, listen, we...


00:14:05.993 --> 00:14:08.996
Maybe my legs are short,
and my beak is tiny.


00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.332
But that's because I'm a small stork!


00:14:11.365 --> 00:14:13.901
But I'm gonna grow up to be a big stork!


00:14:13.935 --> 00:14:16.170
Big and strong! He'll see!


00:14:16.203 --> 00:14:18.339
- Wait!
- You'll all see!


00:14:21.843 --> 00:14:24.812
I can feel it, I can make it to Africa!


00:14:24.846 --> 00:14:25.713
Hmm.


00:14:25.747 --> 00:14:29.016
How hard can it be? It's not like
crossing an ocean or anything.


00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:31.018
Hurry up, you lame ducks!


00:14:31.052 --> 00:14:32.954
The Great Lake awaits!


00:14:32.987 --> 00:14:35.522
I'll show 'em how it's done!


00:14:35.556 --> 00:14:37.491
Speedy stork, coming through!


00:14:39.994 --> 00:14:40.961
Look at that little fella!


00:14:40.962 --> 00:14:43.597
With his speed, we'd be
in Africa in no time.


00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.033
My thoughts exactly!


00:14:46.067 --> 00:14:50.537
Ha ha! I'll just swing by to pick up
the family, then next stop, Africa!


00:14:50.571 --> 00:14:52.874
Argh!


00:14:52.907 --> 00:14:56.277
- Give him a chance, Dad!
- Do not provoke me, son.


00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.046
Storks could never survive the winter


00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:01.983
and sparrows could never
survive the migration.


00:15:02.016 --> 00:15:04.385
Never! That's just fact.


00:15:04.418 --> 00:15:06.553
But he can fly way better than I can!


00:15:06.587 --> 00:15:09.023
Did I not make myself clear?


00:15:09.056 --> 00:15:12.860
Sparrows are not made for
high altitudes. You know this!


00:15:12.894 --> 00:15:15.930
Richard would never
make it there alive, son.


00:15:15.963 --> 00:15:17.464
Is that what you want?


00:15:17.498 --> 00:15:21.535
I... I... Hm.


00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:27.008
- Hey, everybody! I'm home!
- Richard!


00:15:27.041 --> 00:15:29.911
- Are you all right?
- All right?


00:15:29.944 --> 00:15:33.047
Never been better!
I could fly around the world!


00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.649
Enough of this! Time to nest.


00:15:35.682 --> 00:15:37.351
We have a long first leg ahead of us.


00:15:37.384 --> 00:15:40.587
I can't wait!


00:15:40.621 --> 00:15:42.890
Whooo.


00:15:42.924 --> 00:15:44.425
I knew this would happen.


00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.099
Hey, why are you so gloomy?
We're going to Africa!


00:15:52.133 --> 00:15:54.335
Um, I guess I'm just tired.


00:15:54.368 --> 00:15:59.440
- We better crash.
- Good call.


00:15:59.473 --> 00:16:02.043
Gotta be prepped for takeoff!


00:16:02.076 --> 00:16:04.378
Am I right, big guy?


00:16:04.411 --> 00:16:05.947
Good night, beanpole.


00:16:07.949 --> 00:16:10.384
Sleep tight, little brother.


00:16:14.588 --> 00:16:16.657
Mm?


00:16:32.106 --> 00:16:36.210
Africa... Oooh.


00:16:36.243 --> 00:16:39.113
Hm.


00:16:39.146 --> 00:16:41.949
Be safe, Richard.


00:16:48.022 --> 00:16:49.991
We're running out of time.


00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.435
I can't believe we're doing this.


00:17:01.468 --> 00:17:03.270
It's for the best, Max.


00:17:23.024 --> 00:17:25.292
Huh? Good morning!


00:17:25.326 --> 00:17:28.062
Ready, willing and able to migrate!


00:17:28.095 --> 00:17:30.331
Let's get a move on...


00:17:34.035 --> 00:17:36.603
Mom? Dad?


00:17:39.206 --> 00:17:41.508
Max?


00:17:44.311 --> 00:17:47.048
Is that...? No!


00:17:47.081 --> 00:17:50.451
Wait! You forgot me!


00:17:50.484 --> 00:17:53.387
Wait! Wait for me!


00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:58.425
No!


00:18:03.264 --> 00:18:04.498
Come on!


00:18:27.388 --> 00:18:30.224
He looks dead.


00:18:30.257 --> 00:18:31.592
Poke him.


00:18:31.625 --> 00:18:34.661
What's that?


00:18:34.695 --> 00:18:37.164
Fine. I'll poke him.


00:18:37.198 --> 00:18:40.834
Hey, if you're not going to poke,
don't tell me how to poke.


00:18:40.867 --> 00:18:43.204
I do so know how to poke!


00:18:43.237 --> 00:18:45.339
See? Whoops.


00:18:45.372 --> 00:18:49.643
Ow.


00:18:50.744 --> 00:18:52.613
- Hmm...
- Huh?


00:18:52.646 --> 00:18:56.117
- Oooo hoo.
- Ah!


00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.154
Mmm?


00:19:00.187 --> 00:19:03.857
Who... who are you?


00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:08.095
I'm Olga, and this is
my best friend, Oleg.


00:19:10.264 --> 00:19:12.599
We're pygmy owls!


00:19:12.633 --> 00:19:16.237
Right... Oleg...


00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.806
- Um, am I in Africa?
- Mm? Mm!


00:19:28.482 --> 00:19:29.883
Want a bite?


00:19:29.916 --> 00:19:35.222
- Eww.
- More for us.


00:19:35.256 --> 00:19:38.292
Hey! Why would you think this is Africa?


00:19:38.325 --> 00:19:42.163
Oh. That's where I'm migrating
to with the other storks.


00:19:42.196 --> 00:19:45.232
At least I thought I was?


00:19:45.266 --> 00:19:47.501
Yeah, I heard him, Oleg.


00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:55.642
Eh... You do realize you are not
even close to being a stork, right?


00:19:55.676 --> 00:19:58.245
Ha! Shows what you know.


00:19:58.279 --> 00:20:00.447
My dad's leader of the flock.


00:20:02.616 --> 00:20:05.219
Sounds like Daddy issues to me.


00:20:06.687 --> 00:20:08.622
Oh, yeah, Oleg?


00:20:08.655 --> 00:20:11.158
So, why isn't he
with his flock then? Hm?


00:20:11.192 --> 00:20:15.229
Dad never believed in me.
Said I'd never make it.


00:20:15.262 --> 00:20:17.198
Oh! I see!


00:20:17.231 --> 00:20:21.268
Well, when you're not wanted,
you're better off on your own.


00:20:21.302 --> 00:20:23.704
- Right, Oleg?
- Wrong!


00:20:23.737 --> 00:20:27.208
I belong with my flock!
I'll catch up with them.


00:20:27.241 --> 00:20:30.611
And when I get there, my Dad
will see that I am a stork!


00:20:32.713 --> 00:20:34.215
You're very weird.


00:20:34.248 --> 00:20:36.883
I? I am weird?


00:20:36.917 --> 00:20:38.819
O-kay.


00:20:38.852 --> 00:20:42.389
Have fun with your...
"friend" or whatever.


00:20:42.423 --> 00:20:44.191
I'll go find my family.


00:20:45.226 --> 00:20:48.662
Hold your horses!


00:20:48.695 --> 00:20:51.298
South is that way!


00:20:51.332 --> 00:20:55.202
Pfft! Thanks, but we storks
know how to navigate.


00:20:55.236 --> 00:20:58.305
Fine! Go, stork boy!


00:20:58.339 --> 00:21:02.843
Ever seen a crazy bird like that?


00:21:02.876 --> 00:21:05.312
What do you mean, we're alike?


00:21:05.346 --> 00:21:09.383
"Not a stork"? I'll show her!


00:21:09.416 --> 00:21:10.751
Okay...


00:21:10.784 --> 00:21:13.954
They went south, and south is this way!


00:21:17.558 --> 00:21:18.559
No.


00:21:19.793 --> 00:21:21.595
No, south is that way.


00:21:24.398 --> 00:21:27.268
Uh... Or maybe this?


00:21:31.605 --> 00:21:33.807
Mom? Dad?!


00:21:35.542 --> 00:21:37.244
Hi, there.


00:21:37.278 --> 00:21:40.681
Oh!


00:21:40.714 --> 00:21:43.584
This is bad. This is really bad!


00:21:43.617 --> 00:21:45.852
Out of the way!


00:21:45.886 --> 00:21:47.254
Oh!


00:21:47.288 --> 00:21:49.756
- What are those things?
- Hungry!


00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:51.892
Follow us if you want to live!


00:21:58.665 --> 00:22:00.601
I'm right behind you.


00:22:00.634 --> 00:22:02.303
- I'm gonna catch you.
- Wait for us!


00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:07.040
Olga! Ah!


00:22:07.073 --> 00:22:09.443
Oh!


00:22:09.476 --> 00:22:10.777
Get down!


00:22:18.985 --> 00:22:21.355
I see you!


00:22:22.323 --> 00:22:23.824
Wait! I got...


00:22:23.857 --> 00:22:26.927
Oh, no, you don't!


00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:29.363
Surprise!


00:22:31.432 --> 00:22:33.367
Whoa!


00:22:34.768 --> 00:22:37.438
That won't shake them off for long.


00:22:37.471 --> 00:22:40.474
Get up, you two! He's getting away!


00:22:42.976 --> 00:22:44.345
- What now?!
- The light!


00:22:44.378 --> 00:22:46.447
We have to get closer to the light!


00:22:46.480 --> 00:22:47.748
- Got it!
- Wait!


00:22:49.049 --> 00:22:50.016
Yow!


00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.653
Not that close!


00:22:52.686 --> 00:22:54.688
They went over this way!


00:22:54.721 --> 00:22:55.922
Hey, bats!


00:22:55.956 --> 00:22:57.791
What are you doing?!


00:22:59.026 --> 00:23:00.961
- Hey! Let me go!
- You miss us?


00:23:00.994 --> 00:23:03.330
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


00:23:03.364 --> 00:23:04.765
- Yeah!
- Very yummy!


00:23:04.798 --> 00:23:06.600
Stork, you crazy owl!


00:23:07.834 --> 00:23:10.036
- Aah!
- Olga!


00:23:23.417 --> 00:23:27.388
Woo-hoo!


00:23:27.421 --> 00:23:30.791
Awesome!


00:23:30.824 --> 00:23:33.627
I mean... ahem.


00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:36.062
It's not like I needed any help.


00:23:36.096 --> 00:23:38.632
Mm-hmm. Right...


00:23:38.665 --> 00:23:41.702
See? This is what you get
for being nice.


00:23:41.735 --> 00:23:44.538
Big Bird here can take care of himself.


00:23:44.571 --> 00:23:47.007
Let's go chase some mice!


00:23:49.743 --> 00:23:52.746
Eh?


00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:57.851
Olga! Wait! Olga?


00:23:57.884 --> 00:24:00.554
Heh. You're still here?


00:24:00.587 --> 00:24:02.856
Oh, we thought you'd be
in Africa by now.


00:24:02.889 --> 00:24:04.991
Eh, I was thinking...


00:24:05.025 --> 00:24:09.763
Since we storks aren't nocturnal, and
you can see in the dark and all that...


00:24:09.796 --> 00:24:13.734
um, maybe you could, you know, guide me?


00:24:13.767 --> 00:24:15.168
Only until dawn, of course!


00:24:15.201 --> 00:24:19.072
Hmm. Do we look like
bird-sitters to you? No way!


00:24:21.642 --> 00:24:23.410
No, Oleg!


00:24:23.444 --> 00:24:26.680
And don't give me the evil eye!
Time to go home.


00:24:29.483 --> 00:24:32.453
Man, I hate your do-goodery!


00:24:32.486 --> 00:24:35.021
Ugh! We'll play nice.


00:24:35.055 --> 00:24:37.023
- Great, Olga!
- Thank Oleg.


00:24:37.057 --> 00:24:39.926
I'm doing this for him.
Come on, stork boy!


00:24:42.496 --> 00:24:44.465
I'm Richard, by the way.


00:25:03.684 --> 00:25:05.786
He hasn't spoken since we left.


00:25:05.819 --> 00:25:08.589
Max will grow from this.


00:25:08.622 --> 00:25:10.457
We did the right thing for Richard.


00:25:10.491 --> 00:25:13.494
I hope he's all right.


00:25:13.527 --> 00:25:15.496
Don't worry.


00:25:15.529 --> 00:25:18.499
I'm sure he's found
some sparrows by now.


00:25:35.716 --> 00:25:37.718
Huh?


00:25:39.052 --> 00:25:41.187
What?


00:25:43.557 --> 00:25:45.626
Where... where are we?


00:25:45.659 --> 00:25:48.529
What's going on?


00:25:48.562 --> 00:25:50.697
Oh, stop laughing!


00:25:50.731 --> 00:25:54.000
- Hey, Olga!
- I'm not fat!


00:25:54.034 --> 00:25:57.203
Hey, Olga! Wake up!


00:25:57.237 --> 00:26:00.507
Breathe!


00:26:00.541 --> 00:26:02.609
It's okay. Oh.


00:26:04.244 --> 00:26:06.513
- Eww!
- Nice one.


00:26:06.547 --> 00:26:09.115
- What's for breakfast?
- What was that?


00:26:09.149 --> 00:26:11.217
Never seen a pellet before?


00:26:11.251 --> 00:26:13.554
It's a little of this, little of that.


00:26:13.587 --> 00:26:14.788
You don't really wanna know.


00:26:16.222 --> 00:26:18.559
What are we doing on this thing?


00:26:18.592 --> 00:26:20.661
I belong in the air!


00:26:20.694 --> 00:26:22.162
Um, excuse me?


00:26:22.195 --> 00:26:24.297
Who had to fall asleep mid-flight?


00:26:24.330 --> 00:26:27.033
I... I... Hm.


00:26:27.067 --> 00:26:29.570
Exactly! Now chill.


00:26:29.603 --> 00:26:31.572
This thing took us further overnight


00:26:31.605 --> 00:26:33.173
than you could've ever flown.


00:26:33.206 --> 00:26:37.077
Oh, yeah? Then where's my family?


00:26:39.880 --> 00:26:41.582
If you really wanna know...


00:26:41.615 --> 00:26:44.050
What are you talking about?


00:26:44.084 --> 00:26:45.686
Just saying...


00:26:47.353 --> 00:26:49.656
They don't look anything like me.


00:26:49.690 --> 00:26:51.925
- Wow!
- Wow!


00:26:51.958 --> 00:26:55.829
- You're friends with an owl?
- Not friends!


00:26:55.862 --> 00:26:57.097
What?!


00:26:57.130 --> 00:27:01.067
Hi! I've never seen you before.


00:27:01.101 --> 00:27:03.570
A bunch of tourists just dumped
these tasty travel snacks.


00:27:03.604 --> 00:27:05.606
You guys hungry?


00:27:07.373 --> 00:27:10.677
I don't eat trash. I hunt and fish.


00:27:10.711 --> 00:27:13.113
- Oh...
- Suit yourself!


00:27:15.916 --> 00:27:18.585
- What brings you to France?
- Get this!


00:27:18.619 --> 00:27:21.187
He's going south, chasing his flock!


00:27:21.221 --> 00:27:24.090
But... we don't migrate.


00:27:24.124 --> 00:27:26.727
What kind of sparrow are you?


00:27:26.760 --> 00:27:29.730
I... I... I am a stork!


00:27:31.064 --> 00:27:34.067
- Wow. Huh?
- Hmm!


00:27:34.100 --> 00:27:35.602
Don't take it personal.


00:27:35.636 --> 00:27:38.204
He's a late bloomer.


00:27:38.238 --> 00:27:39.906
Oh...


00:27:42.909 --> 00:27:46.780
Poor things! Just wanted to say hi.


00:27:46.813 --> 00:27:50.651
No, thanks. Yeesh, so pushy!


00:27:50.684 --> 00:27:54.120
They're sparrows!
Pushy is their middle name.


00:27:54.154 --> 00:27:56.790
Can we get back to my family?


00:27:56.823 --> 00:27:59.325
Maybe we're close enough
to catch their scent by now.


00:27:59.359 --> 00:28:03.697
Talk about being pushy, right, Oleg?


00:28:03.730 --> 00:28:05.932
- Wait! You found them?
- Ooh!


00:28:05.966 --> 00:28:07.768
Go, Olga, go!


00:28:11.171 --> 00:28:13.006
Wait, this can't be right!


00:28:18.745 --> 00:28:21.014
Ah... what?


00:28:21.047 --> 00:28:24.150
Mein Hawk-Burger just flew away.


00:28:24.184 --> 00:28:27.688
What are you doing?


00:28:27.721 --> 00:28:29.856
Great, just great, Olga.


00:28:29.890 --> 00:28:31.692
My family could be
right around the corner


00:28:31.725 --> 00:28:34.695
and you're busy stuffing your beak!


00:28:34.728 --> 00:28:38.699
First things first, Oleg.
This stuff's magical!


00:28:45.138 --> 00:28:46.707
- Comment!
- Like!


00:28:46.740 --> 00:28:48.208
Huh?


00:28:48.241 --> 00:28:50.443
Fine, stay here.


00:28:50.476 --> 00:28:53.046
But, Oleg, all this delicious stuff!


00:28:55.315 --> 00:28:57.751
All right, all right!


00:29:00.220 --> 00:29:02.689
Hey, guys? Hey! Listen, you...


00:29:02.723 --> 00:29:04.691
- Aah!
- Have! You! Seen!


00:29:04.725 --> 00:29:05.892
A! Flock! Of! Storks!


00:29:05.926 --> 00:29:08.829
Aaah! Ouch!


00:29:08.862 --> 00:29:10.030
What was that?


00:29:10.063 --> 00:29:13.133
A sparrow just tried to hack me!


00:29:13.166 --> 00:29:15.035
Fail! What a troll.


00:29:15.068 --> 00:29:16.737
I'm a stork, got that?


00:29:16.770 --> 00:29:19.873
Not according to the Chick-a-pedia.


00:29:19.906 --> 00:29:22.242
- Ha ha ha. LOL!
- Like!


00:29:22.275 --> 00:29:26.012
- Hello? Someone there?!
- So, what's up?


00:29:26.046 --> 00:29:27.748
They must have fried their bird brains.


00:29:27.781 --> 00:29:29.249
Like!


00:29:29.282 --> 00:29:30.917
I'm wasting my time.


00:29:30.951 --> 00:29:33.720
Hmmm, I think I see how this works.


00:29:33.754 --> 00:29:36.156
- Love! Unfriend!
- Loading!


00:29:36.189 --> 00:29:38.859
Oh, what could possibly go wrong, Oleg?


00:29:38.892 --> 00:29:40.894
All you gotta do...


00:29:40.927 --> 00:29:42.028
Olga?!


00:29:42.062 --> 00:29:45.031
Suddenly I feel so...


00:29:45.065 --> 00:29:48.434
Connected!


00:29:48.468 --> 00:29:51.838
- Huh?
- OMG, an online owl.


00:29:51.872 --> 00:29:55.742
Olga! Can I friend you?


00:29:55.776 --> 00:29:57.109
- Me too! Me too!
- Me too! Me too!


00:29:57.110 --> 00:30:00.346
Uh... Sure! Wow!


00:30:00.380 --> 00:30:02.282
Six new friend requests already!


00:30:02.315 --> 00:30:05.752
- This is fun, Oleg!
- Ask them, Olga!


00:30:05.786 --> 00:30:07.220
Oh, oh, oh, right!


00:30:07.253 --> 00:30:10.223
Seen a flock of storks around?


00:30:10.256 --> 00:30:13.426
Storks? Non. Maybe someone else has.


00:30:13.459 --> 00:30:17.931
I'll check Facebeak.


00:30:17.964 --> 00:30:18.899
Aha!


00:30:18.932 --> 00:30:21.067
A friend of a friend
of a cousin's friend,


00:30:21.101 --> 00:30:23.536
- who I've actually blocked...
- Stalker!


00:30:23.569 --> 00:30:27.540
Says he spotted the storks
on their way to Gibraltar.


00:30:27.573 --> 00:30:30.076
Gibraltar! How do I get there?


00:30:30.110 --> 00:30:32.545
Shortest route or fewest wind farms?


00:30:32.578 --> 00:30:34.781
Never mind.


00:30:34.815 --> 00:30:37.117
I'll send Olga the coordinates...


00:30:38.151 --> 00:30:39.485
Ah!


00:30:39.519 --> 00:30:42.823
- Recalculating...
- Great! Let's go!


00:30:42.856 --> 00:30:44.390
Huh? Huh?


00:30:44.424 --> 00:30:48.061
- Olga?
- Ahh!


00:30:48.094 --> 00:30:49.562
He'll have to wait.


00:30:49.595 --> 00:30:52.465
I'm busy completing my profile!


00:30:52.498 --> 00:30:54.234
Come on, Olga!


00:30:54.267 --> 00:30:56.002
Lead the way!


00:30:59.172 --> 00:31:03.076
Just as I was getting to know her.


00:31:03.109 --> 00:31:05.078
I guess I'm back on the market.


00:31:05.111 --> 00:31:07.948
Like!


00:31:17.357 --> 00:31:21.427
Polly want a stale cracker?


00:31:21.461 --> 00:31:24.264
Because that's all you get
till you bring me customers!


00:31:24.297 --> 00:31:28.835
Sing, Kiki! Sing as if
your life depended on it!


00:31:28.869 --> 00:31:30.971
Which it does!


00:31:37.043 --> 00:31:40.981
♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪


00:31:41.014 --> 00:31:43.283
♪ I love you best... ♪


00:31:43.316 --> 00:31:45.018
Little green waste of space!


00:31:54.360 --> 00:31:57.030
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:31:57.063 --> 00:31:59.332
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:31:59.365 --> 00:32:03.003
♪ Got to let it show, ooh! ♪


00:32:03.036 --> 00:32:04.905
♪ There's a new me coming out... ♪


00:32:08.041 --> 00:32:10.310
Oh...


00:32:10.343 --> 00:32:14.014
- ♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪
- Cheap electronics.


00:32:14.047 --> 00:32:17.917
- ♪ I love you best... ♪
- If you don't shape up, I'm getting a cat!


00:32:19.986 --> 00:32:21.554
Mon Dieu!


00:32:21.587 --> 00:32:24.024
The Sanremo Festival begins tomorrow!


00:32:24.057 --> 00:32:27.093
<i>Attention! The express train
to Sanremo is arriving.</i>


00:32:27.127 --> 00:32:29.896
<i>It leaves immediately
after my coffee break.</i>


00:32:29.930 --> 00:32:31.564
Wait for me!


00:32:31.597 --> 00:32:33.934
I gotta get out of this prison!


00:32:33.967 --> 00:32:36.669
Help me, cracker, you're my only hope.


00:32:39.305 --> 00:32:43.209
Oh, no! I'm doomed!


00:32:43.243 --> 00:32:45.045
- OMG!
- Huh?


00:32:45.078 --> 00:32:48.114
Making friends is so much
easier than I thought!


00:32:48.148 --> 00:32:50.516
So, which way to Gibraltar?


00:32:50.550 --> 00:32:54.921
- Admit it! We're lost!
- It's not that.


00:32:54.955 --> 00:32:59.059
I have to show you.


00:32:59.092 --> 00:33:01.361
Thanks to Pigeon Maps,


00:33:01.394 --> 00:33:06.699
I got a bird's eye view on everything,
only from way up.


00:33:06.732 --> 00:33:11.004
We found you... here.
And... this...


00:33:11.037 --> 00:33:13.439
- is where you're headed.
- Africa!


00:33:13.473 --> 00:33:19.079
Totally. Thanks to Oleg and me,
we are this far already.


00:33:19.112 --> 00:33:20.947
But your storks, man?


00:33:20.981 --> 00:33:23.716
They're approaching Gibraltar over here!


00:33:23.749 --> 00:33:26.452
- That's a mighty long haul!
- So?


00:33:26.486 --> 00:33:29.589
Don't you see?
It would take us a week to get there.


00:33:29.622 --> 00:33:32.959
That's impossible!
You must've taken us the wrong way.


00:33:32.993 --> 00:33:36.462
Whoa! There's nothing
wrong with our senses.


00:33:36.496 --> 00:33:38.498
We're just not as fast as storks.


00:33:38.531 --> 00:33:41.101
And you know why?


00:33:41.134 --> 00:33:44.604
- Because we're not storks.
- That's the problem.


00:33:44.637 --> 00:33:47.173
You're not storks!
You're slowing me down.


00:33:47.207 --> 00:33:52.012
This kid is driving me bananas.


00:33:52.045 --> 00:33:55.048
There just has to be
a faster way to Gibraltar!


00:33:55.081 --> 00:33:59.752
That's my cue.


00:33:59.785 --> 00:34:02.688
Madame, monsieur?


00:34:02.722 --> 00:34:04.490
May I be of assistance?


00:34:04.524 --> 00:34:08.261
- Hmm?
- Aww! Look at you!


00:34:08.294 --> 00:34:13.166
The predator and its prey.
Need to get to Gibraltar?


00:34:13.199 --> 00:34:15.435
My name's Richard and this is Olga.


00:34:15.468 --> 00:34:21.007
- And? Ahem.
- Fine! Olga and Oleg.


00:34:21.041 --> 00:34:24.177
Quoi? Oh, I get it!


00:34:24.210 --> 00:34:27.147
- The owl's gone cuckoo.
- Cuckoo? Us?


00:34:27.180 --> 00:34:30.383
Richard's the one
who thinks he's a stork!


00:34:30.416 --> 00:34:33.786
Oh! Mmm...


00:34:33.819 --> 00:34:36.022
Of course he's a stork!


00:34:36.056 --> 00:34:39.792
The upright posture,
the inimitable elegance...


00:34:39.825 --> 00:34:42.162
- Muah!
- Finally!


00:34:42.195 --> 00:34:44.097
Someone who knows
what he's talking about.


00:34:45.831 --> 00:34:47.533
And just who are you?


00:34:47.567 --> 00:34:53.373
My apologies, Kiki La Spree,
disco parakeet fantastique!


00:34:53.406 --> 00:34:55.808
Ambassador to Sparkleville!


00:34:55.841 --> 00:34:57.643
Distinguished professor of...


00:34:57.677 --> 00:34:58.811
- Blabberbeak?
- Oh!


00:34:58.844 --> 00:35:01.747
I couldn't help but overhear
your little picking match.


00:35:01.781 --> 00:35:05.085
But don't despair.
I can get you to Gibraltar!


00:35:05.118 --> 00:35:09.755
I was headed there myself.
Isn't that an amazing coincidence?


00:35:09.789 --> 00:35:12.492
What does a cage bird want in Gibraltar?


00:35:12.525 --> 00:35:15.228
Why, I'm performing there!


00:35:15.261 --> 00:35:17.063
To welcome the migrating birds!


00:35:17.097 --> 00:35:20.200
At the... uh... Gibraltar Festival!


00:35:20.233 --> 00:35:22.768
Free me and we'll catch
a train out of here


00:35:22.802 --> 00:35:26.139
faster than you can say "Disco Duck"!


00:35:26.172 --> 00:35:27.840
But what's a... train?


00:35:29.642 --> 00:35:33.113
What the what? Ho ho!


00:35:33.146 --> 00:35:35.348
- Voilà.
- Whoa!


00:35:35.381 --> 00:35:38.251
<i>I'm halfway through my café Au lait,
so prepare to board.</i>


00:35:38.284 --> 00:35:40.620
- Oh, no! We have to hurry!
- What?


00:35:40.653 --> 00:35:44.424
He said the train to Gibraltar
is leaving tout de suite!


00:35:44.457 --> 00:35:46.126
You speak human?


00:35:46.159 --> 00:35:51.464
After a zillion hours of karaoke,
even you would, my frizzy feather ball.


00:35:51.497 --> 00:35:53.099
Makes us wonder


00:35:53.133 --> 00:35:55.235
what other tricks you've got
under your plumage.


00:35:55.268 --> 00:35:58.104
Come on, Olga!
Kiki needs our help!


00:35:58.138 --> 00:35:59.205
Merci.


00:35:59.239 --> 00:36:01.774
Now there's a lock underneath,
but be careful.


00:36:04.277 --> 00:36:07.147
- I said be careful!
- What's wrong?


00:36:07.180 --> 00:36:09.149
I am afraid of heights, all right?


00:36:09.182 --> 00:36:10.583
Help!


00:36:12.418 --> 00:36:15.255
- Oy!
- Am I dead?


00:36:15.288 --> 00:36:16.622
Not yet.


00:36:16.656 --> 00:36:19.259
I don't hear you singing!


00:36:19.292 --> 00:36:21.227
- What the...
- Olga! Get him out of here!


00:36:22.362 --> 00:36:25.731
I'm not getting my wings dirty!
You let him out!


00:36:25.765 --> 00:36:29.769
Out of my way! I've got you now!


00:36:32.372 --> 00:36:33.506
No!


00:36:35.175 --> 00:36:40.146
- Where are you taking me?
- Just keep quiet, can you?


00:36:40.180 --> 00:36:42.748
What kind of bird is afraid of flying?


00:36:42.782 --> 00:36:46.752
Flying is for the riff-raff.
I'm a songbird!


00:36:48.354 --> 00:36:51.291
Let go of me, you heartless harpy!


00:36:51.324 --> 00:36:52.825
Oh, okay.


00:36:52.858 --> 00:36:55.295
Just great!


00:36:55.328 --> 00:36:56.662
Hey, he asked me!


00:36:56.696 --> 00:36:59.332
Kiki! Just fly! You're a bird!


00:36:59.365 --> 00:37:02.302
- I can't! Aaaahh!
- Spread your wings!


00:37:02.335 --> 00:37:05.471
- Now taking my final sip...
- The train's leaving.


00:37:05.505 --> 00:37:08.341
- It's all over now.
- No!


00:37:08.374 --> 00:37:11.777
Just let me drop to my deaaaathhh...


00:37:11.811 --> 00:37:15.248
Make it stop!
Make it stop!


00:37:15.281 --> 00:37:17.283
Oh!


00:37:17.317 --> 00:37:19.452
Oh! Tulips!


00:37:23.356 --> 00:37:26.259
Great! Now I'm gonna get bird flu!


00:37:26.292 --> 00:37:28.728
- Huh?
- Help me!


00:37:28.761 --> 00:37:30.330
Birds!


00:37:35.401 --> 00:37:36.101
Oh, no!


00:37:36.135 --> 00:37:38.571
What?!


00:37:38.604 --> 00:37:40.906
That's our train over there!


00:37:40.940 --> 00:37:43.343
<i>All aboard for Sanremo!</i>


00:37:43.376 --> 00:37:46.579
Gibraltar, here we come!


00:38:13.339 --> 00:38:15.741
Dad! We can't keep going!


00:38:15.775 --> 00:38:18.244
- Everyone needs a break!
- No!


00:38:18.278 --> 00:38:19.779
We stick to the prescribed route!


00:38:19.812 --> 00:38:23.416
Can't we at least fly a little lower?


00:38:23.449 --> 00:38:26.386
No. Now keep the formation!


00:38:26.419 --> 00:38:29.789
Stay together, everyone!
Don't fall behind!


00:38:29.822 --> 00:38:32.458
- But Dad!
- Max! Do as I say!


00:38:51.477 --> 00:38:52.745
And when I woke up,


00:38:52.778 --> 00:38:55.348
my brother and my parents were...


00:38:55.381 --> 00:38:57.783
gone.


00:38:57.817 --> 00:39:00.920
I wish I had a dramatic
backstory like that.


00:39:00.953 --> 00:39:05.325
I always dreamed of escaping
my dreary surroundings


00:39:05.358 --> 00:39:08.428
to become a famous disco star!


00:39:08.461 --> 00:39:11.964
Loved... adored...


00:39:11.997 --> 00:39:14.367
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:39:14.400 --> 00:39:16.636
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:39:16.669 --> 00:39:18.738
♪ Got to let... Oh! ♪


00:39:18.771 --> 00:39:21.507
What is "disco," anyway?


00:39:21.541 --> 00:39:26.312
Some kind of courtship behavior
to attract a mate?


00:39:26.346 --> 00:39:27.513
Can be.


00:39:27.547 --> 00:39:30.916
Although I doubt you could
ever pull it off, darling.


00:39:30.950 --> 00:39:34.620
- Hmm!
- Hey!


00:39:34.654 --> 00:39:38.624
I'm used to it. I know
that I'm big and awkward.


00:39:40.493 --> 00:39:43.663
Well... didn't your mama
ever teach you to groom?


00:39:43.696 --> 00:39:46.366
Mmm...


00:39:46.399 --> 00:39:50.470
Let's just say my family
didn't exactly embrace me.


00:39:50.503 --> 00:39:53.439
Maybe with a smooth-out
and some feather-gel...


00:39:53.473 --> 00:39:55.341
Don't you see that I'm freakishly big?


00:39:55.375 --> 00:39:58.711
I've seen way bigger owls
on the Forest Channel.


00:39:58.744 --> 00:40:01.414
Yeah, but not pygmy owls.


00:40:01.447 --> 00:40:05.518
- Guess... uh... not...
- I just never fit in.


00:40:05.551 --> 00:40:08.554
- Sounds familiar.
- No!


00:40:13.158 --> 00:40:15.561
No, I literally didn't fit in.


00:40:15.595 --> 00:40:18.998
I mean, in the nest...


00:40:22.001 --> 00:40:25.805
Pygmy owls are supposed
to be tiny, not giant.


00:40:25.838 --> 00:40:27.272
A "giant pygmy"?


00:40:27.306 --> 00:40:29.909
- Is that like a "jumbo shrimp"?
- Shh!


00:40:35.781 --> 00:40:37.049
Ah!


00:40:44.857 --> 00:40:48.160
♪ Olga is a monster! Olga is a freak! ♪


00:40:57.870 --> 00:41:00.240
Oh... ohhh!


00:41:00.273 --> 00:41:03.809
My own family didn't give
a hoot about me.


00:41:12.051 --> 00:41:16.088
I didn't have a single friend
in the whole world.


00:41:18.524 --> 00:41:20.560
Mm? Mm?


00:41:20.593 --> 00:41:25.798
And then... I met Oleg.


00:41:26.999 --> 00:41:28.734
Ah!


00:41:37.610 --> 00:41:40.513
You've always been there for me.


00:41:40.546 --> 00:41:44.584
Awww... Ditto.


00:41:44.617 --> 00:41:46.986
Ahem. How can I put this?


00:41:47.019 --> 00:41:50.089
Some folks think, for someone to exist,


00:41:50.122 --> 00:41:51.924
you have to see them.


00:41:51.957 --> 00:41:54.994
It sounds kind of crazy, I know.


00:41:55.027 --> 00:41:56.562
Just leave us alone!


00:41:58.631 --> 00:42:00.500
- Nice.
- What?


00:42:04.136 --> 00:42:08.107
It's okay, Olga. I know how you feel.


00:42:10.142 --> 00:42:12.512
<i>Passengers, we will now dim the lights</i>


00:42:12.545 --> 00:42:14.747
<i>and wish you all a good night.</i>


00:42:14.780 --> 00:42:16.982
<i>We'll be in Sanremo in the morning.</i>


00:42:17.016 --> 00:42:18.584
Hmm?


00:42:18.618 --> 00:42:20.820
Uh, uh... He said...


00:42:20.853 --> 00:42:25.024
Uh, the breakfast buffet
has an omelet station


00:42:25.057 --> 00:42:27.026
and the toilet is backed up.


00:42:27.059 --> 00:42:30.630
Time for our beauty sleep!


00:42:30.663 --> 00:42:32.632
Good night!


00:42:36.235 --> 00:42:41.006
Here, hold on to me... if you want to.


00:42:48.247 --> 00:42:52.518
- Almost there.
- Uhh... Yeah.


00:42:52.552 --> 00:42:54.720
Good night, sweethearts.


00:43:21.581 --> 00:43:23.616
Don't feel guilty. Just go.


00:43:23.649 --> 00:43:28.020
Oh, I'm faker than a pair
of faux-leather stilettos.


00:43:28.053 --> 00:43:32.625
Oh, well, a diva has to do
what a diva has to do!


00:43:32.658 --> 00:43:33.658
Oh!


00:43:35.628 --> 00:43:38.731
What has she got in this thing, a piano?


00:43:38.764 --> 00:43:41.033
Oh...


00:43:41.066 --> 00:43:42.101
Kiki, we have to...


00:43:42.134 --> 00:43:43.569
- Kiki?
- Huh?!


00:43:43.603 --> 00:43:44.870
Birds!


00:43:44.904 --> 00:43:47.339
Shoo! Shoo, birds!


00:43:47.372 --> 00:43:49.742
Kiki?


00:43:49.775 --> 00:43:51.577
Kiki!


00:43:53.646 --> 00:43:55.214
Where are you?


00:43:55.247 --> 00:44:00.185
Forget him!
Let's just get outta... Here.


00:44:06.225 --> 00:44:08.728
- Well, if you saw the window, Oleg...
- Look out!


00:44:08.761 --> 00:44:10.362
Then why didn't you say something?


00:44:10.395 --> 00:44:12.798
- Oh!
- Wow. Owl coming through!


00:44:12.832 --> 00:44:14.734
Ooh!


00:44:14.767 --> 00:44:17.670
Oh! Oh, oh!


00:44:21.273 --> 00:44:24.677
Looks like you're not-a from here.


00:44:24.710 --> 00:44:27.880
Looks like-a you could use-a
some help from a local,


00:44:27.913 --> 00:44:31.984
like... Don Crowleone, sí?


00:44:32.017 --> 00:44:33.653
Well, I... eh...


00:44:33.686 --> 00:44:37.890
Hehe, I see you and it-a hit me
like a lasagna to the face!


00:44:37.923 --> 00:44:40.225
There's so many dangers
in this-a town...


00:44:40.259 --> 00:44:43.095
You gonna need-a someone
to a-look out for you, eh?


00:44:43.128 --> 00:44:44.697
Or you might run inta...


00:44:45.798 --> 00:44:48.300
Some very bad birds.


00:44:48.333 --> 00:44:50.169
- Hmm?
- So look.


00:44:50.202 --> 00:44:53.939
We protect you...
for a small-a fee, of course...


00:44:53.973 --> 00:44:57.777
so you can enjoy-a your stay in Sanremo.


00:44:57.810 --> 00:45:01.714
Huh? Sanremo? You mean Gibraltar.


00:45:01.747 --> 00:45:04.684
Scusi, Gibraltar?


00:45:06.218 --> 00:45:08.053
The bambino thinks he's in Gibraltar!
Ha ha!


00:45:09.889 --> 00:45:11.991
You're in beautiful Sanremo!


00:45:12.024 --> 00:45:13.826
- In Italia!
- W-what?


00:45:13.859 --> 00:45:17.262
Why you think-a we got-a
these-a wacky accents, ah?


00:45:17.296 --> 00:45:21.000
- Then where's Africa?
- Africa? Ha!


00:45:21.033 --> 00:45:24.804
- Way-a far away, over the sea.
- No!


00:45:24.837 --> 00:45:26.005
Don't try-a flyin' there,


00:45:26.038 --> 00:45:28.808
or you be swimmin' with the fishes.


00:45:29.942 --> 00:45:32.277
I knew that glittery green
schemer was up to no good!


00:45:32.311 --> 00:45:34.279
You mean-a the parakeet?


00:45:34.313 --> 00:45:36.281
I see him in-a big hurry.


00:45:36.315 --> 00:45:39.151
He asked-a how to get
to the Sanremo Festival.


00:45:39.184 --> 00:45:40.452
Weird little bird.


00:45:40.485 --> 00:45:42.855
Whaaaaat?! He used us!


00:45:42.888 --> 00:45:46.692
Sounds like you've been-a
had big-a-time, bambini.


00:45:46.726 --> 00:45:49.461
Hey!


00:45:49.494 --> 00:45:50.863
Richard!


00:45:50.896 --> 00:45:53.833
Shush!


00:45:55.935 --> 00:45:58.237
Wait... where are you going?


00:45:58.270 --> 00:46:00.840
How could Kiki do this?


00:46:00.873 --> 00:46:03.008
How am I going to reach my family now?


00:46:03.042 --> 00:46:05.745
No, Oleg! Hold your beak.


00:46:05.778 --> 00:46:07.747
It's time I straightened him out.


00:46:09.448 --> 00:46:12.484
You know what, Richard?
Maybe this will teach you.


00:46:12.517 --> 00:46:16.756
You're only in this mess 'cause you
won't accept what you really are.


00:46:16.789 --> 00:46:19.491
I really am totally sick
of arguing this!


00:46:19.524 --> 00:46:22.427
Fine! So then stop! Oleg, tell him!


00:46:22.461 --> 00:46:25.197
As if Oleg really existed!


00:46:25.230 --> 00:46:27.199
Leave him out of this, sparrow!


00:46:27.232 --> 00:46:30.235
Oleg's just in your head! Got it?!


00:46:30.269 --> 00:46:33.505
He's. Not. Real!


00:46:33.538 --> 00:46:35.340
La-la-la-la-la-la!
Aaah!


00:46:37.276 --> 00:46:40.079
Just great.


00:46:40.112 --> 00:46:41.881
My father had it right!


00:46:41.914 --> 00:46:44.817
Storks need to stay with their own kind.


00:46:44.850 --> 00:46:48.187
I never should've followed you. Gah!


00:46:48.220 --> 00:46:51.223
Fine! Go! Leave me!


00:46:51.256 --> 00:46:55.427
I don't need you! I don't need anyone!


00:46:55.460 --> 00:46:57.529
Oh, rats!


00:46:57.562 --> 00:47:01.200
No. I will not follow him!


00:47:01.233 --> 00:47:03.803
Ruffle your feathers
as much as you like.


00:47:03.836 --> 00:47:05.905
Whose side are you on?


00:47:05.938 --> 00:47:07.873
No, you listen, Mr. Do-gooder!


00:47:07.907 --> 00:47:10.542
Whose fault is it
that I'm in this mess, huh?


00:47:10.575 --> 00:47:14.046
You're nothing but trouble, Oleg.


00:47:14.079 --> 00:47:15.781
I wish we never met!


00:47:19.484 --> 00:47:22.822
Hm? Hm?


00:47:22.855 --> 00:47:25.257
Where did you go?


00:47:25.290 --> 00:47:27.226
Oleg?


00:47:30.863 --> 00:47:33.165
Oleg!


00:47:33.198 --> 00:47:36.836
Here! We love you!


00:47:36.869 --> 00:47:38.871
What's that fragrance?


00:47:38.904 --> 00:47:42.441
Why, it's the sweet smell
of superstardom!


00:47:42.474 --> 00:47:45.144
First prize, here I come! Huh?


00:47:45.177 --> 00:47:47.412
Who put this man-shaped mountain here?


00:47:47.446 --> 00:47:48.747
<i>Attenzione!</i>


00:47:48.780 --> 00:47:52.317
<i>All songbirds to the roof
for the Sanremo festival!</i>


00:47:52.351 --> 00:47:53.853
Oh!


00:47:53.886 --> 00:47:57.156
Why do bird events always
have to be high up?


00:47:57.189 --> 00:47:59.825
One... wing in front of the... other.


00:48:01.060 --> 00:48:03.829
Registrazione!


00:48:03.863 --> 00:48:07.332
Registrazione for the
birdsong festival here-a!


00:48:07.366 --> 00:48:10.235
It is showtime!


00:48:12.237 --> 00:48:15.607
Somebody's got to know
the way to Africa around here.


00:48:15.640 --> 00:48:18.177
Storks!


00:48:20.645 --> 00:48:21.881
Hello?


00:48:25.217 --> 00:48:27.119
Hello?


00:48:30.022 --> 00:48:33.158
Anybody home?


00:48:36.561 --> 00:48:38.363
Anybody?


00:48:47.372 --> 00:48:50.575
They must be in Africa by now.


00:48:50.609 --> 00:48:52.077
Aw...


00:48:56.581 --> 00:48:57.917
Oleg!


00:49:00.085 --> 00:49:01.921
Where are you?


00:49:01.954 --> 00:49:03.956
I didn't mean it!


00:49:05.057 --> 00:49:06.959
Come back!


00:49:09.228 --> 00:49:10.662
Post!


00:49:10.695 --> 00:49:13.899
- Share!
- Posting!


00:49:13.933 --> 00:49:16.668
You guys gotta help me!


00:49:16.701 --> 00:49:17.769
I'm looking for Oleg!


00:49:17.802 --> 00:49:22.174
I lost him. I lost Richard.
I lost all my friends.


00:49:22.207 --> 00:49:26.846
Wait! Aren't you that weirdo
owl we heard about online?


00:49:26.879 --> 00:49:28.748
The one who was chasing a sparrow


00:49:28.781 --> 00:49:31.784
- who thought he was a stork?
- Yes! That's me!


00:49:31.817 --> 00:49:33.853
Uh... except for the "weirdo part".


00:49:33.886 --> 00:49:34.754
That's-a you?


00:49:34.787 --> 00:49:38.090
You're-a trending like-a mad! Plug in.


00:49:38.123 --> 00:49:40.893
Yeah. We got-a the hi-speed cable.


00:49:40.926 --> 00:49:42.728
Um, okay.


00:49:42.762 --> 00:49:44.063
But... only for a second.


00:49:44.096 --> 00:49:46.098
Hopefully somebody's seen my friends.


00:49:48.100 --> 00:49:52.204
High speed! Life in the fast lane!


00:49:52.237 --> 00:49:53.739
Told ya!


00:49:53.773 --> 00:49:56.008
Okay, now let's find Oleg.


00:49:57.109 --> 00:50:01.380
OMG! I got 3012 friend requests?!


00:50:02.647 --> 00:50:05.100
Would you mind confirming
my friend request first?


00:50:05.102 --> 00:50:05.919
Mmm?


00:50:05.951 --> 00:50:06.685
Yeah! Mine too!


00:50:06.718 --> 00:50:11.791
Sure! I'll confirm all of them!


00:50:11.824 --> 00:50:13.025
- So many...
- Like!


00:50:13.058 --> 00:50:14.894
- New friends!
- Post!


00:50:17.830 --> 00:50:20.465
Mmm. This is it!


00:50:20.499 --> 00:50:22.835
Your magic moment!


00:50:22.868 --> 00:50:26.939
<i>Welcome to the Sanremo Festival!</i>


00:50:26.972 --> 00:50:29.474
If only I had some friends
to cheer for me.


00:50:29.508 --> 00:50:34.146
<i>And-a now we open the show
with an all-time disco classic.</i>


00:50:34.179 --> 00:50:37.549
Oh, well, the show must go on.


00:50:37.582 --> 00:50:39.785
<i>It's the parakeet
with the tweet so sweet...</i>


00:50:39.819 --> 00:50:42.287
<i>The stunningly gorgeous...</i>


00:50:42.321 --> 00:50:44.824
<i>The breathtakingly beautiful...</i>


00:50:44.857 --> 00:50:47.059
- Koko!
- Oh! What?!


00:50:47.092 --> 00:50:49.261
No, no, no! My name is...


00:50:49.294 --> 00:50:52.397
- Performers only!
- That's what I am!


00:50:52.431 --> 00:50:53.933
Oh, oh, please, please...


00:50:53.966 --> 00:50:56.335
- Oh... no!
- Oh, my!


00:50:56.368 --> 00:50:59.939
Mille grazie!
Mille grazie!


00:50:59.972 --> 00:51:02.241
- ♪ I'm... ♪
- Argh! It can't be!


00:51:02.274 --> 00:51:03.843
- I have to get up there...
- ♪ Coming ♪


00:51:03.876 --> 00:51:05.310
- Ah-ah-ah!
- ♪ Out ♪


00:51:05.344 --> 00:51:07.279
But that's my song!


00:51:07.312 --> 00:51:09.248
♪ I'm coming ♪


00:51:09.281 --> 00:51:11.516
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:11.550 --> 00:51:13.853
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:13.886 --> 00:51:16.355
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:17.990 --> 00:51:19.992
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


00:51:20.025 --> 00:51:21.927
♪ And I just had to live ♪


00:51:21.961 --> 00:51:23.495
♪ And I want to give... ♪


00:51:37.576 --> 00:51:42.882
I can do this! Hmm!


00:51:45.885 --> 00:51:48.320
♪ ...got to let it show ♪


00:51:48.353 --> 00:51:51.223
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:51.256 --> 00:51:53.625
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:53.658 --> 00:51:56.228
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:52:00.065 --> 00:52:01.901
- Go on!
- Yeah!


00:52:01.934 --> 00:52:04.870
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:52:04.904 --> 00:52:06.872
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:52:06.906 --> 00:52:08.240
♪ Got to let it show... ♪


00:52:09.541 --> 00:52:11.076
<i>Attenzione, passengers!</i>


00:52:11.110 --> 00:52:16.348
<i>Ferry departs to Tunis, Africa, Pier 12.</i>


00:52:19.919 --> 00:52:23.488
Oh, ferry to Africa... pfft!


00:52:23.522 --> 00:52:27.159
This dreamboat's got
nothing left to twirl for.


00:52:27.192 --> 00:52:33.398
Au revoir, fame!
Bonjour, oblivion!


00:52:33.432 --> 00:52:36.068
Luigi! Everybody's at-a the cliffs!


00:52:36.101 --> 00:52:40.072
A sparrow wants to fly
across-a da sea to Africa!


00:52:40.105 --> 00:52:43.342
But-a that's-a crazy dangerous!


00:52:43.375 --> 00:52:45.911
Great! Let's-a go!


00:52:47.079 --> 00:52:49.949
Richard?


00:52:49.982 --> 00:52:53.085
Oh! I've got to stop him!


00:52:56.321 --> 00:53:00.225
Oh, I can't, I just can't!


00:53:00.259 --> 00:53:03.929
But Richard needs me! Ah! Eh!


00:53:03.963 --> 00:53:08.900
Here comes Kiki! Whoa! Whoa!


00:53:11.003 --> 00:53:15.074
Oh, no, no, no!
It'll be all right, Richard!


00:53:22.114 --> 00:53:24.950
Good job, little piggy!


00:53:26.118 --> 00:53:28.954
Olga?! Oh! Oh!


00:53:28.988 --> 00:53:33.092
For the love of Donna Summer,
what are you doing?


00:53:35.060 --> 00:53:37.496
I'm tilling my virtual farm.


00:53:37.529 --> 00:53:39.999
Leave her alone,
or I'll block-a your access!


00:53:40.032 --> 00:53:43.102
# PeskyParakeet!


00:53:43.135 --> 00:53:44.636
Oh... oh!


00:53:44.669 --> 00:53:46.972
Re-post!


00:53:51.210 --> 00:53:52.344
What have you done?


00:53:52.377 --> 00:53:54.479
Let's find another hotspot, quick!


00:53:54.513 --> 00:53:57.082
Dislike!


00:53:57.116 --> 00:53:58.650
- Richard needs our help!
- You!


00:53:58.683 --> 00:54:01.153
Why should I trust you?


00:54:01.186 --> 00:54:03.188
You tricked me once already,


00:54:03.222 --> 00:54:08.660
you deceitful, manipulative
superficial parakeet!


00:54:08.693 --> 00:54:11.263
Richard thinks he can fly
across the sea all by himself!


00:54:11.296 --> 00:54:13.698
But he'll never make it!


00:54:13.732 --> 00:54:16.068
We go to stop him!


00:54:16.101 --> 00:54:19.504
He left me, just like Oleg did.
Why should I care?


00:54:19.538 --> 00:54:22.041
Because you're friends!


00:54:22.074 --> 00:54:24.143
- Oh...
- Aw.


00:54:24.176 --> 00:54:27.012
Richard needs you. It's true.


00:54:27.046 --> 00:54:29.148
Ooh... ooh... ahh!


00:54:29.181 --> 00:54:32.151
I'll break your groove-thing


00:54:32.184 --> 00:54:34.019
if this is another one of your tricks!


00:54:34.053 --> 00:54:37.322
Eat me alive if you want! Just hurry!


00:54:37.356 --> 00:54:40.459
- Come on!
- I got you.


00:54:40.492 --> 00:54:42.027
Man, you're heavy for a parakeet.


00:54:42.061 --> 00:54:43.462
Said the giantess?


00:54:56.141 --> 00:54:57.442
Whoa!


00:54:57.476 --> 00:55:01.046
Hurry! That wacky sparrow's
a-gonna jump offa da cliff!


00:55:01.080 --> 00:55:04.583
With those-a winds?
He's-a cuckoo!


00:55:04.616 --> 00:55:06.818
I bet-a you three
herrings he goes-a splat.


00:55:06.851 --> 00:55:07.986
- Huh?
- You're on!


00:55:08.019 --> 00:55:11.490
- You can do it!
- Come on! Do it!


00:55:16.095 --> 00:55:17.562
- Jump!
- Come on!


00:55:17.596 --> 00:55:21.200
- Richard!
- Don't jump!


00:55:21.233 --> 00:55:24.203
We had a bet!


00:55:24.236 --> 00:55:25.737
Can't you see I'm busy here?


00:55:25.770 --> 00:55:27.672
No, Richard! It will kill you!


00:55:27.706 --> 00:55:30.442
- Yeah!
- Forgive me, please!


00:55:30.475 --> 00:55:33.212
I know I've been despicable.


00:55:33.245 --> 00:55:36.281
I beg you. Let me make it up to you!


00:55:36.315 --> 00:55:38.283
- Jump!
- Do it, do it, do it!


00:55:38.317 --> 00:55:41.853
I've lost Oleg already.
I can't lose you too!


00:55:41.886 --> 00:55:45.757
There's a safe way across to Africa.
A ferry!


00:55:45.790 --> 00:55:47.726
It's like a train that floats on water.


00:55:47.759 --> 00:55:50.195
No. I am a stork!


00:55:50.229 --> 00:55:52.097
Time I started acting like one.


00:55:57.269 --> 00:55:58.870
Richard!


00:56:04.143 --> 00:56:05.477
Just great.


00:56:05.510 --> 00:56:07.779
See you big boys over the rainbow!


00:56:08.947 --> 00:56:13.152
I bet-a you six herring
the green one chokes first.


00:56:16.455 --> 00:56:19.158
- Spread your wings!
- I can't! I can't!


00:56:21.326 --> 00:56:23.795
Heeeeere I cooooome!


00:56:35.540 --> 00:56:38.277
- There they go!
- Ho ho, yeah!


00:56:38.310 --> 00:56:43.282
- Pay up!
- Fine.


00:56:48.320 --> 00:56:50.255
Are we going down or up?


00:56:50.289 --> 00:56:53.225
We'll know if we crash and drown!


00:56:58.697 --> 00:57:01.333
Oh?


00:57:01.366 --> 00:57:02.834
Wow!


00:57:02.867 --> 00:57:05.204
This is amazing!


00:57:05.237 --> 00:57:08.340
Dazzle-tastic!


00:57:08.373 --> 00:57:11.810
This is definitely going in my memoirs.


00:57:11.843 --> 00:57:14.613
Too beautiful to stand!


00:57:14.646 --> 00:57:17.482
Right, Oleg? Oh.


00:57:17.516 --> 00:57:18.550
Mmm...


00:57:18.583 --> 00:57:22.187
Oh, wow...


00:57:22.221 --> 00:57:25.224
Oh...


00:57:25.257 --> 00:57:29.194
Africa, here we cooome!


00:57:43.408 --> 00:57:47.946
Look, a shooting star!
Everybody make a wish.


00:57:54.919 --> 00:57:59.358
That is no shooting star!


00:57:59.391 --> 00:58:01.693
And definitely not what I wished for!


00:58:06.565 --> 00:58:10.235
Darnit, not again.
There's something on the scope.


00:58:21.280 --> 00:58:24.283
Running on a plane
was not on my bucket list!


00:58:24.316 --> 00:58:27.018
Stay together!


00:58:29.421 --> 00:58:31.390
Olgaaaa!


00:58:38.930 --> 00:58:41.400
Where is Olga?


00:58:41.433 --> 00:58:42.934
Over there!


00:58:42.967 --> 00:58:47.639
- Olga!
- We'll save you, darling!


00:58:54.479 --> 00:58:56.047
Whoa!


00:58:56.080 --> 00:58:57.749
We have to find somewhere to land.


00:58:59.384 --> 00:59:01.920
In the middle of the sea?!


00:59:01.953 --> 00:59:03.488
There! What's that?


00:59:03.522 --> 00:59:05.624
An ocean liner!


00:59:11.330 --> 00:59:12.330
Whoo!


00:59:24.643 --> 00:59:28.480
I always wanted to learn
synchronized swimming.


00:59:28.513 --> 00:59:31.316
Olga!


00:59:31.350 --> 00:59:33.485
Darling!


00:59:33.518 --> 00:59:34.653
No!


00:59:42.427 --> 00:59:44.496
Oh!


00:59:44.529 --> 00:59:47.098
Olga! Come on! Get up!


00:59:47.131 --> 00:59:50.669
I know what to do!


00:59:52.371 --> 00:59:55.106
First aid poster.


00:59:55.139 --> 00:59:57.509
I stared at the thing for years.


00:59:57.542 --> 01:00:01.480
Come on. Olga, come on!


01:00:01.513 --> 01:00:04.749
Oh... oh...


01:00:08.520 --> 01:00:13.525
It's... too late.


01:00:13.558 --> 01:00:15.394
No.


01:00:22.701 --> 01:00:24.803
Oleg?


01:00:24.836 --> 01:00:27.539
Please...


01:00:27.572 --> 01:00:28.873
Can you help her?


01:00:31.843 --> 01:00:34.879
It's all my fault, and I'm sorry.


01:00:36.681 --> 01:00:38.983
Please bring her back!


01:00:39.017 --> 01:00:41.453
She needs you more than ever, Oleg.


01:00:57.436 --> 01:00:59.838
Ah...


01:00:59.871 --> 01:01:01.540
- Oh...
- Huh?


01:01:01.573 --> 01:01:04.476
- Oleg? Is that you?
- Ha ha!


01:01:04.509 --> 01:01:07.412
- Yes!
- All right, yes! You're back!


01:01:09.614 --> 01:01:13.552
Whoa!


01:01:13.585 --> 01:01:16.888
Eww! Oh...


01:01:16.921 --> 01:01:20.859
This is the best gift I've ever gotten!


01:01:20.892 --> 01:01:23.928
Oh...


01:01:23.962 --> 01:01:26.498
Missed you, too, Oleg.


01:01:34.673 --> 01:01:40.211
This... is the life.


01:01:40.244 --> 01:01:43.482
"Indulge yourself in our luxury spa,


01:01:43.515 --> 01:01:46.618
with 'all-you-can-heat'
sauna privileges,


01:01:46.651 --> 01:01:49.120
as we near our destination of..."


01:01:49.153 --> 01:01:50.288
Hey!


01:01:50.321 --> 01:01:54.659
You'll never guess where
we're headed, tweethearts!


01:01:54.693 --> 01:01:56.160
Africa!


01:01:56.194 --> 01:01:58.597
You can join the other storks after all!


01:01:58.630 --> 01:02:00.599
Ahem. Mm.


01:02:00.632 --> 01:02:03.201
Huh? Oh...


01:02:05.036 --> 01:02:08.907
"Other storks"?


01:02:08.940 --> 01:02:11.476
Claudius was right.


01:02:11.510 --> 01:02:14.946
You all were. I'm not a stork.


01:02:14.979 --> 01:02:17.549
I'll never be one.


01:02:17.582 --> 01:02:20.451
I'm just a sparrow.


01:02:25.123 --> 01:02:27.692
You really love them, don't you?


01:02:27.726 --> 01:02:29.193
Your storks.


01:02:29.227 --> 01:02:31.963
Mm-hmm.


01:02:31.996 --> 01:02:35.667
Then I say we show them
who you really are.


01:02:35.700 --> 01:02:39.671
But... what if they don't want me?


01:02:39.704 --> 01:02:43.508
There's only one way to find out.


01:02:43.542 --> 01:02:46.277
Are... are you sure?


01:02:46.310 --> 01:02:48.680
- Mm-hmm.
- Otherwise, I'll adopt!


01:02:48.713 --> 01:02:51.215
Oh!


01:02:53.685 --> 01:02:55.820
I just did a Gloria half-Gainer!


01:02:55.854 --> 01:02:57.689
Come on, bird of paradise.


01:02:57.722 --> 01:03:00.024
Let's find a place to sleep it off.


01:03:00.058 --> 01:03:01.159
All right.


01:03:01.192 --> 01:03:03.828
Hey, maybe there's a disco on this tub!


01:03:15.574 --> 01:03:17.576
Hmm.


01:03:21.012 --> 01:03:24.549
Storks! Prepare to land!


01:03:24.583 --> 01:03:27.852
We can rest here until the heat passes.


01:03:29.588 --> 01:03:32.691
Ahh, what a lovely death gulley!


01:03:32.724 --> 01:03:35.694
But... there was water here last year!


01:03:35.727 --> 01:03:37.261
I'm never wrong about these things!


01:03:37.295 --> 01:03:39.197
The riverbed dried up.


01:03:39.230 --> 01:03:43.702
Humans built another one
of their stupid dams.


01:03:44.769 --> 01:03:47.572
I know some other water
holes around here.


01:03:47.606 --> 01:03:49.708
I could show you, if you like.


01:03:49.741 --> 01:03:53.845
Thank you, sir, but your
assistance is not required.


01:03:53.878 --> 01:03:55.079
Hmm.


01:03:55.113 --> 01:03:58.617
Yeah? Fine. Storks!


01:03:58.650 --> 01:04:01.853
I'll go find water. Do not wander off.


01:04:01.886 --> 01:04:04.956
You could've accepted his help.
He seemed nice.


01:04:04.989 --> 01:04:07.759
Our flock can take care of itself.


01:04:07.792 --> 01:04:09.260
I know what I'm doing.


01:04:09.293 --> 01:04:12.897
Yeah... I can see that.


01:04:12.931 --> 01:04:15.366
You will not speak to me
in this way, Max!


01:04:15.399 --> 01:04:16.801
Stop it, will you?


01:04:16.835 --> 01:04:19.738
I'm only being reasonable,


01:04:19.771 --> 01:04:22.741
and doing what is best for all of us.


01:04:22.774 --> 01:04:24.308
All of us? Really?


01:04:24.342 --> 01:04:26.778
Even my little brother?!


01:04:26.811 --> 01:04:28.647
- You just don't get it!
- Max!


01:04:28.680 --> 01:04:31.382
Stay with the flock!


01:04:31.415 --> 01:04:34.152
Go after him!


01:04:34.185 --> 01:04:36.587
Max!


01:04:41.325 --> 01:04:43.795
Big mean dummy.


01:04:43.828 --> 01:04:46.064
Jerk.


01:04:46.097 --> 01:04:47.832
It's a dangerous place!


01:04:47.866 --> 01:04:49.634
I hate you!


01:04:51.169 --> 01:04:53.304
Oh? Oh!


01:04:59.310 --> 01:05:01.846
He-hello?


01:05:01.880 --> 01:05:03.114
Who's there...


01:05:06.818 --> 01:05:09.654
Max? My boy?


01:05:15.694 --> 01:05:18.029
I can't believe we're in Tangier!


01:05:19.798 --> 01:05:21.933
Africa!


01:05:23.735 --> 01:05:25.336
Hot stuff! Ooh, baby!


01:05:25.369 --> 01:05:27.371
Which way to the Great Lake, Olga?


01:05:27.405 --> 01:05:29.708
Hm... let's see.


01:05:29.741 --> 01:05:30.675
Richard!


01:05:30.709 --> 01:05:33.044
You're that sparrow
who thinks he's a stork!


01:05:33.077 --> 01:05:35.046
We have some good news for you.


01:05:35.079 --> 01:05:37.348
- Your flock is nearby!
- Oh!


01:05:37.381 --> 01:05:39.317
Just in!


01:05:39.350 --> 01:05:41.185
They're, like, totally in trouble!


01:05:41.219 --> 01:05:43.855
A-something about
the Flock Leader's son...


01:05:43.888 --> 01:05:45.356
"Wax"?


01:05:45.389 --> 01:05:46.725
Max!


01:05:46.758 --> 01:05:47.625
That's the one!


01:05:47.658 --> 01:05:50.361
He vanished without a trace.


01:05:50.394 --> 01:05:52.463
- By the oasis.
- Oasis?


01:05:52.496 --> 01:05:53.965
I need to get there now!


01:05:53.998 --> 01:05:56.367
Er, maybe we could take him, darling.


01:05:56.400 --> 01:06:00.038
- It's not that far.
- What?! Get offline?!


01:06:00.071 --> 01:06:01.906
Did you catch a virus?


01:06:01.940 --> 01:06:03.742
Come on! Hurry! Please!


01:06:03.775 --> 01:06:06.177
We got to help him, snookums!


01:06:08.747 --> 01:06:11.082
Hey! This is better than I remembered!


01:06:11.115 --> 01:06:12.917
Come, my lovebird!


01:06:12.951 --> 01:06:15.820
Never! I'll miss a personality quiz!


01:06:15.854 --> 01:06:17.421
- Whoa!
- Trust me.


01:06:17.455 --> 01:06:19.090
You don't want to miss this.


01:06:23.427 --> 01:06:26.931
Everything's so... real!


01:06:26.965 --> 01:06:29.100
- Hurry! To the oasis!
- Love!


01:06:29.133 --> 01:06:33.872
Oh, well! There goes my vacation.


01:06:33.905 --> 01:06:35.874
Oh, I wish I'd brought my sunglasses!


01:06:39.477 --> 01:06:41.880
Max!


01:06:41.913 --> 01:06:45.884
Max!


01:06:45.917 --> 01:06:49.821
It's impossible!


01:06:49.854 --> 01:06:51.756
If only that boy had listened to me...


01:06:51.790 --> 01:06:54.058
- What are we going to do?
- I don't know what else...


01:06:54.092 --> 01:06:55.994
Where is Max?!


01:06:59.230 --> 01:07:01.532
Richard?


01:07:01.565 --> 01:07:03.902
How... how can that be?


01:07:03.935 --> 01:07:06.905
Mom! What happened to Max?


01:07:06.938 --> 01:07:07.972
He ran away.


01:07:08.006 --> 01:07:09.841
And... and we found his footsteps,


01:07:09.874 --> 01:07:11.442
leading into this tunnel.


01:07:11.475 --> 01:07:14.212
I tried everything,
but I couldn't get in.


01:07:14.245 --> 01:07:17.115
Not good... Not good at all.


01:07:17.148 --> 01:07:21.085
This is the entrance to the honey
badger's underground lair.


01:07:21.119 --> 01:07:23.988
Honey badger doesn't
sound so bad, right?


01:07:24.022 --> 01:07:25.824
Yeah! I'm gonna get Max out of there.


01:07:25.857 --> 01:07:26.991
Oh, no!


01:07:27.025 --> 01:07:30.094
The honey badger's the most
fearless predator of all.


01:07:30.128 --> 01:07:33.397
Instant death is pretty much a given.


01:07:33.431 --> 01:07:36.935
- Uh-huh? How would you know?
- Basic cable.


01:07:36.968 --> 01:07:39.003
- Ah.
- Okay, I'm going in.


01:07:39.037 --> 01:07:41.139
No! It's too dangerous for you...


01:07:41.172 --> 01:07:42.807
We have no other choice!


01:07:42.841 --> 01:07:45.343
You storks don't fit
through that entrance.


01:07:45.376 --> 01:07:46.945
We're coming with you!


01:07:46.978 --> 01:07:50.314
We'll show this badger
some honey, right, Kiki?


01:07:50.348 --> 01:07:52.016
Right, Kiki?!


01:07:52.050 --> 01:07:55.987
Remind me again why I'm signing
up for this kamikaze mission?


01:07:57.221 --> 01:07:59.858
Because you tricked us and you feel bad.


01:07:59.891 --> 01:08:02.526
Oh. Yeah. Count me in.


01:08:04.028 --> 01:08:05.964
- Richard!
- What?!


01:08:05.997 --> 01:08:11.602
Be careful. Please.


01:08:11.635 --> 01:08:12.971
Hmm.


01:08:18.542 --> 01:08:20.979
I'll guard the entrance!


01:08:29.888 --> 01:08:31.956
Oh, this was a bad idea.


01:08:34.558 --> 01:08:36.060
And I know bad ideas.


01:08:36.094 --> 01:08:38.062
"Bad idea" is my middle name!


01:08:38.096 --> 01:08:40.331
Shh!


01:08:41.599 --> 01:08:43.968
I'm a disco-lover, not a badger-fighter!


01:08:44.002 --> 01:08:46.070
Oh!


01:08:47.405 --> 01:08:48.940
He must be this way.


01:08:48.973 --> 01:08:52.576
Good. So let's go...


01:08:52.610 --> 01:08:53.878
that way.


01:08:53.912 --> 01:08:55.013
Okay, okay!


01:08:58.216 --> 01:09:00.885
That's slightly creepy.


01:09:00.919 --> 01:09:04.923
Is that... Max?


01:09:04.956 --> 01:09:07.926
That look like bird bones to you?


01:09:07.959 --> 01:09:11.162
How should I know? I'm vegan.


01:09:11.195 --> 01:09:14.198
And I'm a meat-eater. Remember that.


01:09:19.203 --> 01:09:22.073
So, ah, you guys give any more thought


01:09:22.106 --> 01:09:24.342
to my "running away" idea?


01:09:24.375 --> 01:09:27.611
Everyone, take a tunnel.
But be silent, okay?


01:09:29.047 --> 01:09:30.881
That means you, Showtune.


01:09:32.216 --> 01:09:34.218
- Hey!
- Shh!


01:09:34.252 --> 01:09:35.419
Take your tunnel!


01:09:35.453 --> 01:09:38.122
Can't we at least flip a coin?


01:09:38.156 --> 01:09:39.357
Shake a tailfeather!


01:09:40.959 --> 01:09:44.162
Well, at least I'll leave
a gorgeous corpse.


01:09:48.066 --> 01:09:49.968
Max?


01:09:53.104 --> 01:09:54.104
Max?


01:10:07.685 --> 01:10:09.087
Hmm.


01:10:12.156 --> 01:10:13.457
Mmm, hearty crunch.


01:10:13.491 --> 01:10:16.460
With a delightfully gooey center.


01:10:16.494 --> 01:10:18.496
Max?


01:10:18.529 --> 01:10:20.231
Whoa!


01:10:34.478 --> 01:10:36.580
Max!


01:10:36.614 --> 01:10:38.316
Is he okay?


01:10:38.349 --> 01:10:40.118
Phew!


01:10:41.785 --> 01:10:45.289
- Get up, Max!
- Oh.


01:10:45.323 --> 01:10:49.093
Oh? Little brother?


01:10:49.127 --> 01:10:52.130
Oh! How did you... get here?


01:10:52.163 --> 01:10:56.034
Shh! We've gotta get you out of here.


01:10:56.067 --> 01:10:57.135
Where's Kiki?


01:10:57.168 --> 01:11:00.171
Oh, great.


01:11:00.204 --> 01:11:03.374
My dry-cleaning bill is
going to be astronomical!


01:11:09.247 --> 01:11:11.115
I'm seeing double. Triple. Quadruple!


01:11:14.818 --> 01:11:19.190
Running away! Running away!


01:11:23.061 --> 01:11:25.096
- It's him!
- Ooops! Sorry.


01:11:25.129 --> 01:11:26.097
Great.


01:11:26.130 --> 01:11:27.398
This way out!


01:11:29.233 --> 01:11:31.102
Which tunnel?


01:11:33.071 --> 01:11:34.105
This one looks good!


01:11:36.540 --> 01:11:38.176
Kiki!


01:11:41.212 --> 01:11:43.681
I'm too colorful to die!


01:11:52.690 --> 01:11:54.392
Oh!


01:11:57.628 --> 01:12:00.264
♪ Monsieur Honey Badger! ♪


01:12:00.298 --> 01:12:01.298
Huh?


01:12:02.533 --> 01:12:05.169
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


01:12:05.203 --> 01:12:07.238
♪ And I just had to live ♪


01:12:07.271 --> 01:12:09.107
♪ And I wanna give ♪


01:12:09.140 --> 01:12:11.242
♪ I'm completely positive ♪


01:12:11.275 --> 01:12:13.211
♪ I think this time around ♪


01:12:13.244 --> 01:12:15.213
♪ I am gonna do it ♪


01:12:15.246 --> 01:12:17.581
♪ Like you never knew it ♪


01:12:17.615 --> 01:12:20.084
♪ Ooh, I'll make it through ♪


01:12:20.118 --> 01:12:21.238
♪ The time has come for me ♪


01:12:21.252 --> 01:12:23.187
♪ To break out of this shell ♪


01:12:23.221 --> 01:12:25.589
♪ I have to shout ♪


01:12:25.623 --> 01:12:27.191
♪ I am coming out ♪


01:12:27.225 --> 01:12:28.759
Huh?


01:12:33.564 --> 01:12:36.134
Olga, Kiki! Get Max out of here!


01:12:36.167 --> 01:12:37.368
But what about you?


01:12:37.401 --> 01:12:38.669
Just do it!


01:12:43.807 --> 01:12:45.876
- Just my luck.
- A dead end?


01:12:45.909 --> 01:12:48.546
Everybody, keep looking!


01:12:48.579 --> 01:12:51.282
There must be another way to get in!


01:12:51.315 --> 01:12:53.417
- Huh?
- Dad! Mom!


01:12:53.451 --> 01:12:55.253
- We're here!
- Max!


01:12:55.286 --> 01:12:56.854
Dig here!


01:13:00.791 --> 01:13:03.394
Ahh! Beaks!


01:13:03.427 --> 01:13:06.764
- Ah!
- Ouch!


01:13:08.299 --> 01:13:10.501
Son! Oh!


01:13:10.534 --> 01:13:12.303
I'm so sorry.


01:13:12.336 --> 01:13:13.804
Dad! Richard's still in there.


01:13:13.837 --> 01:13:14.905
No!


01:13:26.950 --> 01:13:28.286
Ah!


01:13:29.687 --> 01:13:31.189
Richard! Get out of there!


01:13:38.196 --> 01:13:40.598
Don't you touch him, you beast!


01:13:46.870 --> 01:13:50.241
- It's collapsing!
- That cave wasn't up to code!


01:13:53.811 --> 01:13:55.213
Oh!


01:13:55.246 --> 01:13:58.182
Here, honey bunny!


01:13:58.216 --> 01:14:00.718
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


01:14:13.231 --> 01:14:15.199
Oh!


01:14:38.856 --> 01:14:40.524
Richard!


01:14:40.558 --> 01:14:42.560
Where... where is he?


01:14:44.027 --> 01:14:45.729
- Richard?
- Come on out!


01:14:48.266 --> 01:14:51.269
Can you see him, Oleg?


01:14:51.302 --> 01:14:53.504
Oh, no.


01:15:06.884 --> 01:15:09.620
Huh?


01:15:11.822 --> 01:15:13.924
Do you see what I see?


01:15:13.957 --> 01:15:15.793
What?


01:15:19.763 --> 01:15:21.332
Richard!


01:15:21.365 --> 01:15:23.567
- Oh!
- It's Richard!


01:15:23.601 --> 01:15:24.735
Yeah! Ha ha!


01:15:24.768 --> 01:15:25.969
What?


01:15:30.941 --> 01:15:33.043
Just in time, little brother.


01:15:33.076 --> 01:15:37.348
Oh, you sure know
how to make an entrance.


01:15:38.782 --> 01:15:41.619
Oh... I'll never let you go again!


01:15:44.322 --> 01:15:45.923
How did you ever get here?


01:15:45.956 --> 01:15:48.892
Everybody, these are my friends,


01:15:48.926 --> 01:15:50.828
- Olga and Kiki...
- Ahem.


01:15:50.861 --> 01:15:53.431
And Oleg.


01:15:53.464 --> 01:15:54.931
I wouldn't be here
if it wasn't for them.


01:15:54.932 --> 01:15:57.335
Enchanté!


01:15:57.368 --> 01:16:00.070
It was our pleasure, right, Oleg?


01:16:04.342 --> 01:16:07.377
I owe you an apology, Richard.


01:16:09.112 --> 01:16:11.815
I should have believed in you.


01:16:11.849 --> 01:16:16.286
Sparrow or stork... you are my son.


01:16:23.060 --> 01:16:26.430
I... I can be part of the family?


01:16:26.464 --> 01:16:29.099
Nothing would make me prouder.


01:16:35.473 --> 01:16:36.840
Mmm.


01:16:36.874 --> 01:16:38.709
Aww!


01:16:41.078 --> 01:16:43.881
Next stop, the Great Lake!


01:16:43.914 --> 01:16:46.116
Richard...


01:16:46.149 --> 01:16:48.352
would you lead us?


01:16:48.386 --> 01:16:50.488
Really?! Me?


01:16:50.521 --> 01:16:54.625
When you're ready, give the signal.


01:16:54.658 --> 01:16:56.527
Hey, Richard?


01:16:56.560 --> 01:16:59.497
South is that way!


01:17:05.436 --> 01:17:08.639
Follow me!


01:17:08.672 --> 01:17:10.408
Wait for us!


01:17:10.441 --> 01:17:12.810
We're not all storks, you know!


01:17:12.843 --> 01:17:15.145
Come on, everyone! Keep the pace!


01:17:15.178 --> 01:17:18.516
Jeez, little brother!
Been training?


01:17:21.485 --> 01:17:23.921
Ah...


01:17:34.031 --> 01:17:36.400
Whoa! That must be it!


01:17:36.434 --> 01:17:40.538
Yeah! The Great Lake!


01:17:43.741 --> 01:17:47.678
Ooh! Now that's what I call
a deluxe resort!


01:17:47.711 --> 01:17:50.748
Thanks, Oleg.


01:17:50.781 --> 01:17:53.050
I couldn't have done it without you.


01:17:54.618 --> 01:17:57.688
We did it. We really did it!


01:17:57.721 --> 01:18:01.058
Woo-hoo!


01:18:01.091 --> 01:18:05.963
Come on, guys! Yeah!

